---
layout: base.njk
title: Our work
permalink: /archive/
description: Riptide's back catalogue of immersive, interactive and digital work since 2014 — with venues, credits and press for each project.
---

<section class="band band--flush band--waves">
  {% include "page-waves.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); line-height: 1; margin: 0;">Our work</h1>
    <p class="lede work-intro">Past riptides have taken us to rooftop bars, and underground libraries. From Leeds to the streets of Buenos Aires. In busy nightclubs, empty city streets, hotel rooms, on your phones and through your letterbox. <em>A decade of work that still swirls.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="band live-head" aria-labelledby="live-title">
  <div class="wrap live-head__inner">
    <h2 id="live-title" class="live-head__title"><span class="tide__live"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Live and available now</span></h2>
    <ul class="live-head__list">
      {% for show in collections.current %}<li><a href="{{ show.url }}">{{ show.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

{% set shows = collections.current %}
{% include "tide.njk" %}

<section class="band lc" aria-labelledby="lc-title">
  <div class="wrap lc__inner">
    <div class="lc__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow ab-eyebrow">The series</p>
      <h2 id="lc-title" class="display lc__title">Lost Connections</h2>
      <p class="lc__lede">Lost Connections is a series of socially engaged work which Riptide will create over the next 5 years.</p>
      <p class="lc__strong"><strong>We live in the loneliest, most-disconnected society in human history.</strong> It is through our artwork that we can find connection to ourselves, to our community and our surroundings.</p>
      <p class="lc__stat"><span class="display">49%</span> <span>of adults (25.99 million people) in the UK report feeling lonely occasionally, sometimes, often or always</span></p>
      <p class="lc__body">Lost Connections is rooted in the ancient teachings of meditation, mindfulness and ritual, and infuses modern scientific research about connection. We want to engage people with in a new way by combining the experience with innovative uses of VR and AI technology.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="lc__list">
      <li class="lc__item">
        <a class="lc__dot" href="/project-intimacy/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/gift-pi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" style="object-position: 70% 50%"></a>
        <div>
          <h3 class="lc__name"><a href="/project-intimacy/">Project Intimacy</a></h3>
          <p class="lc__when">2020 – current</p>
          <p>A 14-day SMS experience aimed at connecting like-minded strangers through a series of curated prompts.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="lc__item">
        <a class="lc__dot" href="/intermission/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/intermission.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></a>
        <div>
          <h3 class="lc__name"><a href="/intermission/">Intermission</a></h3>
          <p class="lc__when">2026–7</p>
          <p>A bespoke, 90 minute immersive experience, aimed at combatting the mental health epidemic. A fusion of immersive theatre, XR technology and wellbeing techniques. Huge collaboration with artists, wellness experts and National partners.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="lc__item">
        <span class="lc__dot" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/lc-journey.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="lc__name">Journey back to human…</h3>
          <p class="lc__when">2027–8</p>
          <p>A durational participatory experience for a small community. Set in rural surrounds, a curated artwork designed to re-find our connection with nature.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint arc" aria-labelledby="arc-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="arc__head">
      <h2 id="arc-title" class="display">Past Work</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="arc__list">
      {% for show in collections.past | byYearDesc %}
      <li class="arc__row">
        <a class="arc__link" href="{{ show.url }}">
          <span class="arc__year">{{ show.data.year }}</span>
          <span class="arc__main">
            <span class="arc__title display">{{ show.data.title }}</span>
            <span class="arc__meta">{% if show.data.format | isFilled %}{{ show.data.format }}{% endif %}{% if (show.data.format | isFilled) and (show.data.place | isFilled) %} · {% endif %}{% if show.data.place | isFilled %}{{ show.data.place }}{% endif %}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="arc__about">
            {% if show.data.partLine %}<span class="arc__line arc__line--part">{% for bit in show.data.partLine.split(", ") %}<span class="nw">{{ bit }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span>{% elif show.data.summary | isFilled %}<span class="arc__line">{{ show.data.summary }}</span>{% elif show.data.tagline %}<span class="arc__line">{{ show.data.tagline }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% set q = (show.data.press | filledBy("quote"))[0] or (show.data.quotes or [])[0] %}
            {% if q %}<span class="arc__quote">“{{ q.quote }}” <cite>{{ q.source }}</cite></span>{% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="arc__thumb" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ show.data.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
          <span class="arc__go" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        {% if show.data.trailerUrl %}<a class="arc__trailer" href="{{ show.data.trailerUrl }}"{% if not show.data.trailerVideo %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>See the trailer here &rarr;</a>{% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/tide.js?v={{ build.v }}" defer></script>
